### Criar um dispositivo REST
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "sensor_sala_101",
  "protocol": "REST",
  "sala": "256",
  "departamento": "Informatica",
  "piso": "1",
  "edificio": "Espirito Santo",
  "ativo": true
}

### Criar um dispositivo gRPC
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "gateway_01",
  "protocol": "GRPC",
  "sala": "126",
  "departamento": "Informatica",
  "piso": "1",
  "edificio": "CLAV",
  "ativo": true
}

### Criar um dispositivo MQTT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "sensor_sala_01",
  "protocol": "MQTT",
  "sala": "150",
  "departamento": "Informatica",
  "piso": "1",
  "edificio": "Espirito Santo",
  "ativo": true
}

### Listar todos os dispositivos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices

### Listar um dispositivo específico
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/sensor_sala_101

### Enviar métrica via REST
POST http://localhost:8080/api/metrics/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "sensor_sala_01",
  "temperatura": 22.5,
  "humidade": 45.0,
  "timestamp": "2026-01-07T14:30:00"
}

### Ver médias de métricas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/metrics/average?level=edificio&id=CLAV